        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675160/extras/637e578e4f73ea04274c852a44f8a9aa.avif?t=1788921652\" width=882 height=88 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Open Island Exorcist RPG</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>After an earthquake, monsters from folklore roam a quiet island </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>just off the coast of modern Japan.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>But the legendary exorcist maiden Miko from the past is here to battle them!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Take control of her and restore peace to the island!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>(While not the whole world, the island is open for you to explore!)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Miko may have forgotten a few things during her long, long sleep,</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>but there's nothing like some intense fighting to shake up her memory.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>So what do we got?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Featuring side-view battles with moving sprites!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chop-up enemies with a deadly chainsaw and unleash hell with a blazing flamethrower!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the island as you want!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The portable toilets(portaloos) help with fast travel!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fishing! Farming! Industry?!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Catch fish, grow vegetables, domesticate wild boars and chickens, and even build your own factory!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A story of new encounters, partings, and adventure.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Why was the legendary exorcist maiden sealed? Why have monsters resurfaced?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This story is by no means a tearjerker, but playing through to the end is sure to leave you with a warm feeling in your heart.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675160/extras/9653d1c6f0e303d156b24d311bee8775.avif?t=1788921652\" width=882 height=88 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fishing! Farming! Livestock! Even factories!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn skill points to unlock new abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft and upgrade weapons and armor, and fuse accessories</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the island freely — go wherever you like!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjustable difficulty settings</p></li></ul>",
