aiden sealed? Why have monsters resurfaced?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This story is by no means a tearjerker, but playing through to the end is sure to leave you with a warm feeling in your heart.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675160/extras/9653d1c6f0e303d156b24d311bee8775.avif?t=1788921652\" width=882 height=88 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fishing! Farming! Livestock! Even factories!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn skill points to unlock new abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft and upgrade weapons and armor, and fuse accessories</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the island freely — go wherever you like!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjustable difficulty settings</p></li></ul>",
